{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaaX7AEXkfVUF23MxmDC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I proved `myRep_add` in `Main.lean`, and `lean Main.lean` now finishes with no errors or warnings.\n\n```lean\ntheorem myRep_add (a : α) (m n : Nat) : myRep a (m + n) = myRep a m ++ myRep a n := by\n  induction m with\n  | zero => simp [myRep]\n  | succ m ih => rw [Nat.succ_add, myRep, myRep, ih, List.cons_append]\n```\n\nThe proof works by induction on `m`:\n- **Base case (`m = 0`):** `simp` reduces `0 + n` to `n` and `myRep a 0` to `[]`, and the equation follows.\n- **Step case (`m + 1`):** `Nat.succ_add` rewrites `(m + 1) + n` as `(m + n) + 1`, so `myRep` can unfold on both sides. The induction hypothesis then rewrites `myRep a (m + n)`, and `List.cons_append` closes the goal."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":510,"cache_read_input_tokens":7871,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":510},"output_tokens":329,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c788934a-bcd8-4b5b-882f-29d5ccd79f17","uuid":"85e3d0b2-2d97-42ba-bd0f-d94d3dd3bd0c","timestamp":"2026-10-31T15:49:05.336Z","request_id":"req_011CgaaX6uMdz1SUtfVs4D2i"}
